OL,3,AJump in energy bills drives UK
OL,4,Ainflation to highest rate for four
OL,5,Amonths
OL,6,
OL,7,FHigher energy bills drove UK inflation
OL,8,Fup to 2.9% in the year to July, the
OL,9,Fhighest level in four months, according
OL,10,Fto new figures.
OL,12,FGas prices soared at the sharpest pace
OL,13,Fin almost four years, the Office for
OL,14,FNational Statistics (ONS) said, leading
OL,15,Fto an increase in the cap on household
OL,16,Fenergy bills in July. Energy costs
OL,17,Fsurged after US-Israel war with Iran
OL,18,Fbegan, which has restricted global oil
OL,19,Fsupplies.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
