OL,3,AThunderstorm warnings issued for parts
OL,4,Aof UK with flash flooding expected
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in areas impacted by
OL,7,Fthunderstorms have been told by the Met
OL,8,FOffice to expect that businesses and
OL,9,Fhomes could flood, transport services
OL,10,Fcould be delayed and power cuts are
OL,11,Flikely.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
