OL,3,ABurnham unveils plan to get rough
OL,4,Asleepers off streets for Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery rough sleeper in England will be
OL,7,Foffered accommodation this winter, the
OL,8,Fprime minister has said.
OL,10,FAndy Burnham made ending rough sleeping
OL,11,Fhis first pledge when entering Downing
OL,12,FStreet in July and now says he wants
OL,13,F"to get everyone in for Christmas".
OL,15,FEmergency accommodation will be
OL,16,Fprovided to end the need for rough
OL,17,Fsleeping alongside practical support
OL,18,Ffor any health needs, as part of a
OL,19,F#442m package.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
