OL,3,ABurnham unveils plan to get rough
OL,4,Asleepers off streets for Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative shadow housing secretary
OL,7,FSir James Cleverly said Burnham
OL,8,Fpromised to end rough sleeping in
OL,9,FGreater Manchester when mayor of the
OL,10,Farea but "failed because he didn't do
OL,11,Fthe hard work necessary".
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
