OL,3,ATrump pauses new tariffs on Canada for
OL,4,Athree days, saying deal close
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump said he will
OL,7,Fdelay imposing new tariffs on a wide
OL,8,Farray of Canadian goods for three days
OL,9,Fas the countries firm up a trade deal.
OL,11,F"I have paused the 50% Tariffs against
OL,12,FCanada, that were scheduled to kick in
OL,13,Ftomorrow morning for a three day
OL,14,Fperiod, based on the fact that Canada
OL,15,Fand the U.S.A., subject to the
OL,16,Ffinalization of documents, have a
OL,17,FDEAL!" Trump said in a social media
OL,18,Fpost.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
