OL,3,ATrump pauses new tariffs on Canada for
OL,4,Athree days, saying deal close
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe announcement came less than two
OL,7,Fhours before a 50% levy on nearly $20bn
OL,8,F(#14.8bn; C$28bn) of Canadian imports
OL,9,Fwas set to go in place.
OL,11,FThe two sides have been at an impasse
OL,12,Fon several issues, including US tariffs
OL,13,Fon autos and many Canadian provinces
OL,14,Fbanning American liquor sales.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
